          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"spike-short-trade-replay\">Spike Short Trade Replay</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Pick a trade, then press <strong>\u25b6 Play</strong> to watch the morning one minute at a time: the run to <strong>+5%</strong>, the first red bar\n(<strong>arm</strong>), the <strong>short</strong>, and the <strong>cover</strong> 20 minutes later. The purple pane is the risk models' <strong>P(continuation loser)</strong>\nif the short were entered at the next bar; above the dashed <strong>veto</strong> line the model would skip the trade.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><small>Alpaca SIP 1-minute bars. Models are trained on Jul 2025 \u2013 Jun 2026 only, so Q3 and Oct\u2013Nov trades are scored out of sample.\nCharts: TradingView Lightweight Charts (Apache-2.0). Paper research only.</small></span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
